tags: [[Profile Picker]]
title: New Profile
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

''New…'' prompts for a title, creates a profile tagged for the dropdown, and opens it in the editor.  Use it when you're starting fresh against unfamiliar source JSON — or, if you have a profile's JSON already (from a guide, a forum post, a colleague), paste it into the box under the title and the editor opens on the finished profile.

If a profile with that title already exists, the prompt warns you and offers to open the existing one instead.
